## Rules

- Start from what changes; trace with the recipes ([02]({{ref_02}})) and record each command and result.
- Check every impact category in the map ([01]({{ref_01}})).
- Each affected behavior is ADDED / MODIFIED / REMOVED against the built code, with a reason; REMOVED says what happens to existing data and users; AC rows trace to it ([04]({{ref_04}})).
- Each hit is "behavior changes" (a task) or "regression only" (a test).
- Not settled by tracing → a `Q-NN`, never "no impact".
- A contract break is flagged for versioning and for its consumers.

